+> STOP. Captain's notes: non-binding. Captain writes, Captain trims. Anyone else: close this file now.
+
+# Captain Notes
+
+Binding behaviour lives in `.feature` specs and referenced `assets/**`. History lives in git. These notes carry only what the next cycle needs.
+
+## Voyage 1 Status
+
+Specs and watchbill authored. 33 scenarios across 10 feature files. No step definitions, no production code. Next role: QM, who writes step definitions and verification support, then dispatches Crew per failing target.
+
+## Decisions
+
+- localStorage key: `todos-vanilla` (vanilla JS implementation).
+- Feature files split by behaviour domain: new-todo-creation, editing-todos, toggling-todos, mark-all-complete, clear-completed, visibility, counter, deleting-todos, routing, persistence.
+- No `@contract` scenarios in this voyage: the app has no external API or schema to attest. The product is the DOM.
+- Routing spec uses `#/` prefix (hash-based) per the app-spec's allowance of `#!/`.
diff --git a/features/clear-completed.feature b/features/clear-completed.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..f6efddb
--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/clear-completed.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+Feature: Clear completed
+  As a user
+  I want to remove all completed todos at once
+  So that I can clean up my list
+
+  Scenario: Clearing completed todos
+    Given the app is loaded with an incomplete todo "Task A" and a completed todo "Task B" and a completed todo "Task C"
+    When the user clicks the Clear completed button
+    Then the todo "Task A" is displayed in the list
+    And the todo "Task B" is not displayed
+    And the todo "Task C" is not displayed
+    And the Clear completed button is not visible
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed button is hidden when no todos are completed
+    Given the app is loaded with an incomplete todo "Task A"
+    Then the Clear completed button is not visible
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed button is shown when at least one todo is completed
+    Given the app is loaded with an incomplete todo "Task A" and a completed todo "Task B"
+    Then the Clear completed button is visible
diff --git a/features/counter.feature b/features/counter.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..51ba445
--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/counter.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,23 @@
+Feature: Active todo counter
+  As a user
+  I want to see how many todos remain
+  So that I know my remaining workload
+
+  Scenario: Counter shows singular form for one item
+    Given the app is loaded with no todos
+    When the user types "Buy groceries" in the new todo input and presses Enter
+    Then the todo counter displays "1 item left"
+
+  Scenario: Counter shows plural form for multiple items
+    Given the app is loaded with a todo "Task A"
+    When the user types "Task B" in the new todo input and presses Enter
+    Then the todo counter displays "2 items left"
+
+  Scenario: Counter reflects only active todos
+    Given the app is loaded with an incomplete todo "Task A" and a completed todo "Task B"
+    Then the todo counter displays "1 item left"
+
+  Scenario: Counter updates when a todo is completed
+    Given the app is loaded with a todo "Task A"
+    When the user clicks the toggle checkbox on the todo "Task A"
+    Then the todo counter displays "0 items left"
diff --git a/features/deleting-todos.feature b/features/deleting-todos.feature
