+Feature: Toggling todos
+  As a user
+  I want to mark individual todos as complete or incomplete
+  So that I can track my progress
+
+  Scenario: Completing a todo via its checkbox
+    Given the app is loaded with a todo "Buy groceries"
+    When the user clicks the toggle checkbox on the todo "Buy groceries"
+    Then the todo "Buy groceries" is marked as completed
+    And the todo counter displays "0 items left"
+
+  Scenario: Uncompleting a completed todo
+    Given the app is loaded with a completed todo "Buy groceries"
+    When the user clicks the toggle checkbox on the todo "Buy groceries"
+    Then the todo "Buy groceries" is not marked as completed
+    And the todo counter displays "1 item left"
diff --git a/features/visibility.feature b/features/visibility.feature
