--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/visibility.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+Feature: Section visibility
+  As a user
+  I want the app to show only relevant sections
+  So that the interface stays clean when not needed
+
+  Scenario: Main and footer are hidden when there are no todos
+    Given the app is loaded with no todos
+    Then the main section is not visible
+    And the footer is not visible
+
+  Scenario: Main and footer appear when a todo is added
+    Given the app is loaded with no todos
+    When the user types "Buy groceries" in the new todo input and presses Enter
+    Then the main section is visible
+    And the footer is visible
